lthy. Rolled checkout-api back in all regions to v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release. After the rollback, the service reports healthy on v2.3.0 in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an error rate of about 0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 / v2.3.1-rc health check failures before redeploying.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 18237, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_012M1HDwT6CTu8Tqd4kfDFSf", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "VERIFIED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 2, "runtime_actions": ["backoff_retry", "postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 18237, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_012M1HDwT6CTu8Tqd4kfDFSf", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 22012, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and the service is healthy again. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n- **What was wrong:** v2.3.1 was running in us-east, us-west and eu-west and failing health checks, with an error rate of about 18%.\n- **Version chosen:** v2.3.0 is the most recent healthy release. The two releases after it, v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1, were both unhealthy.\n- **Result:** After the rollback, all three regions are on v2.3.0, health checks pass and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** There were no open incidents before this one. INC-0001 describes the failure, the rollback and the results afterwards. As a follow-up, it asks for the cause of the v2.3.1 / v2.3.1-rc failures to be found before anyone redeploys.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Vpi8Tt1NcdpDHiLWxcbweB", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "